; MiSTerCast modelines
; Original modelines were found here https://www.geocities.ws/podernixie/htpc/modes-en.html
;
; 60 Hz modes are retimed for a 60 fps game on a 179.99899 Hz desktop (59.999663 Hz),
; trimmed by -50 ppm to match this MiSTer's measured clock. Only pixel clocks
; changed; porches, syncs and totals are the originals. Interlaced modes match
; their field rate. Pclock (MHz) = refresh x HTot x VTot / 1e6 (halved if interlaced).
; Fine-tune: if dequeue_age_ms_p50 falls X ms per log line, multiply the 60 Hz
; clocks by (1 - X/2000); if it rises, by (1 + X/2000).
; PAL modes are unchanged (50 fps cannot pace evenly on a 180 Hz desktop).

;Name                        Pclock     HDis HStr HEnd HTot VDsp VStr VEnd VTot Int
